      "P1": "Constrained <r> collapses >30% at alpha* (discontinuous transition)",
      "P2": "Constrained entropy fraction at alpha* connects to Bekenstein B2 ~ 0.913",
      "P3": "d^2(constrained_S)/dalpha^2 peaks >5x baseline near alpha*",
      "P4": "alpha*(n) follows a predictable scaling law (R^2 > 0.9)"
    }
  },
